worry|verb|VERB|Feel anxious|To feel anxious about a possible problem.|lo lắng|Try not to worry about the delay.|Hãy cố đừng lo về sự chậm trễ.|Worry about; no treatment advice.|0
worry|feeling|NOUN|Anxious feeling|A feeling of anxiety about something.|sự lo lắng|Worry kept her awake.|Sự lo lắng khiến cô ấy thức.|Usually uncountable state.|1
worry|concern|NOUN|Specific concern|A particular problem or thought that causes anxiety.|nỗi lo|His main worry was the missing document.|Nỗi lo chính của anh ấy là tài liệu bị mất.|Countable; a worry.|2
while|time|CONJUNCTION|During the time that|Used to connect events happening during the same period.|trong khi|She read while I prepared dinner.|Cô ấy đọc trong khi tôi chuẩn bị bữa tối.|While plus clause.|0
while|period|NOUN|Short period|A period of time, often fairly short.|một lúc; một lát|We rested for a while.|Chúng tôi nghỉ một lát.|A while; for a while.|1
while|contrast|CONJUNCTION|Contrast two situations|Used to show a contrast between two facts.|còn; trong khi|She likes tea, while he prefers coffee.|Cô ấy thích trà, còn anh ấy thích cà phê.|Contrasting clauses.|2
wake|awaken|VERB|Stop sleeping|To stop sleeping or cause someone to stop sleeping.|thức dậy; đánh thức|The noise woke the baby.|Tiếng ồn đánh thức em bé.|Wake, woke, woken; transitive or intransitive.|0
what|pronoun|PRONOUN|Ask about a thing|Used to ask which thing, action, or information is meant.|gì; cái gì|What caused the delay?|Điều gì gây ra sự chậm trễ?|Pronoun as subject or object.|0
what|determiner|DETERMINER|Ask about a specified category|Used before a noun to ask for information about it.|nào; gì|What time does the shop open?|Cửa hàng mở cửa lúc mấy giờ?|What plus noun.|1
who|question|PRONOUN|Ask about a person|Used to ask the identity of a person.|ai|Who sent the invitation?|Ai gửi thư mời?|Interrogative person pronoun.|0
who|relative|PRONOUN|Introduce information about a person|Used to introduce a clause describing a person.|người mà; mà|The neighbour who helped us is a teacher.|Người hàng xóm đã giúp chúng tôi là giáo viên.|Relative pronoun; subject of subordinate clause.|1
